  "question": {
    "text": "A clock has $75 \\mathrm{~cm}, 60 \\mathrm{~cm}$ long second hand and minute hand respectively. In 30 minutes duration the tip of second hand will travel $x$ distance more than the tip of minute hand. The value of $x$ in meter is nearly (Take $\\pi=3.14$ ) :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
